<section class="parcels section"><div class="section-top"><div><p class="eyebrow">A place to put down roots</p><h2>Parcels with<br><em>possibility.</em></h2></div><p>Choose a plot that fits the way you want to live, grow and build.</p></div><div class="parcel-grid"><article><b>01</b><h3>Residential</h3><p>Beautiful plots for a first or second home.</p></article><article><b>02</b><h3>Light industrial</h3><p>Purposeful space for enterprise and industry.</p></article><article><b>03</b><h3>Agricultural</h3><p>Room for a farmhouse and subsistence farming.</p></article></div></section>
