<section id="location" class="location section"><div><p class="eyebrow">Location / map</p><h2>Connected to<br><em>everything.</em></h2><p>Find Changai Garden City at the centre of a growing network of towns, services and transport links.</p><a class="button primary" href="#contact">Get directions ↗</a></div><div class="map"><span class="pin">●</span><strong>Changai Garden City</strong><small>Phase 1</small><i>Makuyu Centre</i><i>Kenol Town</i><b>N</b></div></section>
<section id="contact" class="contact section"><div><p class="eyebrow">Customer form</p><h2>Register<br><em>your interest.</em></h2><p>Fill in the form to register your interest.</p><address><strong>Changai Garden City Ltd</strong><br>Off Njathaini Road<br>Nairobi County</address></div><form @submit.prevent="submitInterest"><div class="form-row"><label>Name:<input name="name" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your name"><small v-if="formErrors.name">{{formErrors.name}}</small></label><label>Email:<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com"><small v-if="formErrors.email">{{formErrors.email}}</small></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>Phone:<input name="phone" type="tel" inputmode="tel" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="+254 700 000 000"><small v-if="formErrors.phone">{{formErrors.phone}}</small></label><label>Message:<textarea name="message" rows="3" placeholder="How can we help?"></textarea><small v-if="formErrors.message">{{formErrors.message}}</small></label></div><button class="button primary" type="submit">Submit ↗</button><p v-if="submitted" class="success">Thank you — we’ll be in touch shortly.</p></form></section></main>
<footer><a class="brand" href="#home"><img class="mark logo" :src="logo" alt="Changai Garden City logo"><span><b>changai</b><small>GARDEN CITY</small></span></a><p>Living meets nature.</p><span>© {{ year }} Changai Garden City</span></footer></div>
